const T4 = "<section class=\"mm-gal\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Steel Building Gallery</h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Florida steel barn and pole barn projects built for lasting strength and versatility.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/gallery\">Project Gallery<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-mosaico mm-mosaico--6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pole-barn-10/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-10.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Wood and steel pole barn structure under construction, designed and installed by expert Florida building contractors.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pole-barn-10/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-10.jpg\" alt=\"Wood and steel pole barn structure under construction, designed and installed by expert Florida building contractors.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pole-barn-9/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-09.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Aerial view of metal roof pole barn construction, showcasing professional steel building installation in Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pole-barn-9/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-09.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of metal roof pole barn construction, showcasing professional steel building installation in Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pole-barn-8/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-08.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom-built steel pole barn with open sides, offering versatile coverage solutions across South Florida properties.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pole-barn-8/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-08.jpg\" alt=\"Custom-built steel pole barn with open sides, offering versatile coverage solutions across South Florida properties.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/banco/pole/pole-barn-open-equipment-shed-steel-trusses-florida-01.webp\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Long three-sided pole barn with wood posts, black steel trusses and metal walls on a dirt floor.\"><img src=\"/images/banco/pole/pole-barn-open-equipment-shed-steel-trusses-florida-01.webp\" alt=\"Long three-sided pole barn with wood posts, black steel trusses and metal walls on a dirt floor.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pole-barn-6/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-06.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Steel pole barn installation with high-clearance design, perfect for equipment, vehicles, and commercial operations in Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pole-barn-6/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-06.jpg\" alt=\"Steel pole barn installation with high-clearance design, perfect for equipment, vehicles, and commercial operations in Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pole-barn-5/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-05.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom pole barn construction over concrete slab, engineered for long-term durability by Florida building contractors.\"><img src=\"/images/images/pole-barn-5/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-05.jpg\" alt=\"Custom pole barn construction over concrete slab, engineered for long-term durability by Florida building contractors.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><script type=\"application/json\" class=\"mm-gal-mas\">[{\"url\":\"/images/images/pole-barn-4/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-04.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Covered pole barn with steel roof and treated wood posts, providing durable outdoor storage solutions in Florida.\"},{\"url\":\"/images/images/pole-barn-1/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-01.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Custom pole barn construction with steel roof and concrete slab, built by licensed contractors in North & South Florida.\"},{\"url\":\"/images/images/pole-barn-3/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-03.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Large open-span pole barn with steel roofing, designed for storage, workshops, and commercial use across North & South Florida.\"}]</script></section><div><section class=\"mm-que\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Steel &amp; Pole Barn Construction Services in Florida</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We construct steel buildings and pole barns in North &amp; South Florida, engineered for hurricane resistance and long-term durability.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Pole Barns &amp; Livestock Shelters</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We frame pole barns on treated posts or steel columns, then sheet them with ribbed panels and fasteners that carry Florida Building Code product approval. For horses and livestock we detail open bays, ridge vents and kickboards, and we specify galvanized hardware that survives salt air and daily washdowns.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Custom Pole Barn Builders</dt><dd>Custom Pole Barn Builders\nDescription: North &amp; South Florida contractors design and build custom pole barns for residential properties.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Agricultural Barn Installation</dt><dd>Contractors construct metal barns for horses and livestock, using durable, pest‑resistant materials.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo mm-grupo--activo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Garages, Workshops, Storage Buildings</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Steel garages and workshops sit on a slab we pour with thickened edges, with anchor bolts set to the column layout. Insulated panels and a vented ridge hold down the radiant heat these buildings trap in a Florida summer, and we size doors around the trucks, boats or equipment going inside.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Steel Garage Construction</dt><dd>Builders install steel garages and workshops that meet local codes and withstand Florida weather.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Custom Workshop &amp; Storage Buildings</dt><dd>South Florida builders design custom steel workshops and storage buildings with energy‑efficient insulation.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Engineered Kits, Wind Ratings</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Pre-engineered kits arrive with sealed engineering, and we erect them to those drawings exactly, with no field substitutions on connections or anchor bolts. We match each building to the design wind speed at its address, and inside Broward's High-Velocity Hurricane Zone we use approved assemblies, bracing and hold-downs.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pre‑Engineered Steel Kit Assembly</dt><dd>Installers erect pre‑engineered steel building kits on concrete foundations for homeowners.\n</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Weather‑Rated Steel Building Installation</dt><dd>Builders install hurricane‑rated steel buildings engineered to handle heavy winds and rain.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Commercial Builds &amp; Renovations</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">For home businesses and equipment yards we build commercial-grade frames with taller eaves, wider bays and slabs rated for loaders and trailers. On an existing barn we replace corroded purlins and rusted skin, add a lean-to or enclose open bays, and bring the older structure up to current code.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Commercial‑Grade Metal Buildings</dt><dd>North Florida installers build durable metal structures for home businesses and equipment storage.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Steel Building Renovation Services</dt><dd>Contractors renovate and expand existing pole barns and steel buildings for residential use.</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-que-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/images/pole-barn-10/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-10.jpg\" alt=\"Pole barn frame with timber posts and roof trusses\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"02 / 04\" data-t=\"Garages, Workshops, Storage Buildings\"></div></figure></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Steel Building <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our builders manage engineering, permitting, and full steel barn construction to deliver hurricane-rated structures across North and South Florida.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-proc-medio\" data-mm-pasos-medio=\"\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-045/pole-barn-construction-slab-prep-aerial-florida-proceso0.avif\" alt=\"Aerial view of a compacted sand pad being prepared for a concrete slab beside pole framing on a rural lot.\" width=\"1599\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"01 / 04\" data-t=\"Site Evaluation &amp; Structural Assessment\"></div></figure><ol class=\"mm-pasos\" data-mm-pasos=\"\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-045/pole-barn-construction-slab-prep-aerial-florida-proceso0.avif\" alt=\"Aerial view of a compacted sand pad being prepared for a concrete slab beside pole framing on a rural lot.\" width=\"1599\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Site Evaluation &amp; Structural Assessment</h3><p>Comprehensive site survey capturing lot dimensions, soil conditions, setback requirements, and intended use. We assess building size requirements, foundation needs, and local code compliance to determine engineering specifications.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-114/pole-barn-construction-posts-steel-trusses-aerial-florida-proceso1.avif\" alt=\"Aerial view of pole barn posts with three steel trusses set, braced with lumber, and an auger skid steer.\" width=\"1599\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Custom Design &amp; Structural Engineering</h3><p>Detailed design of steel building or pole barn structure with professional engineering for load-bearing capacity, beam sizing, and foundation requirements. 3D renderings and full material specifications provided.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-114/pole-barn-construction-roof-purlins-crew-florida-proceso2.avif\" alt=\"Crew installing wood roof purlins on a pole barn frame, with metal roofing panels staged on the grass.\" width=\"1599\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Building Permits &amp; Code Compliance</h3><p>Permit acquisition for steel structure including wind-load certifications, setback verification, and structural engineering approvals per Florida Building Code. HVHZ compliance for high-wind zones where applicable.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-114/pole-barn-construction-metal-roof-install-aerial-florida-proceso3.avif\" alt=\"Aerial view of galvanized metal roof panels being installed over the purlins of a pole barn.\" width=\"1599\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Construction &amp; Final Inspection</h3><p>Full construction including foundation work, steel framing installation, roofing, and all finishing components. Final inspections confirm structural integrity and code compliance for delivery and handover.</p></li></ol></div></section>";
const T6 = "<section class=\"mm-faq\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Steel &amp; Pole Barn <span class=\"mm-rot\">FAQs</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Have questions about steel building or pole barn construction in Florida? Our licensed contractors answer the top questions from Florida clients.</p></div></div><div class=\"mm-faq-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-faq-lista\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Why choose steel buildings over wood in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Steel buildings outperform wood construction by resisting hurricanes, moisture, mold, and pests, requiring less long-term maintenance. In Florida's demanding climate, a properly engineered steel structure delivers decades of reliable performance for storage, agriculture, or commercial use.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Are steel barns hurricane-rated in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Our steel barns are engineered to meet Florida building codes and withstand winds exceeding 180 mph, making them a reliable choice throughout hurricane season. Each structure includes wind-load engineering documentation required for permit approval across North and South Florida counties.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Are steel buildings low-maintenance in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Steel structures require very little ongoing maintenance compared to wood alternatives. Galvanized and powder-coated finishes resist rust, mold, and pest damage across Florida's humid, salt-air environment. Occasional cleaning and bolt inspections are all that's needed to keep your structure performing reliably for decades.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can steel buildings be expanded after construction?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Steel frame structures are modular, making future expansions straightforward. Additional bays, lean-to additions, and interior mezzanines can be engineered and permitted without compromising the original structure. Our team designs with growth in mind, so modifications align with Florida building codes and existing certifications.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Are steel structures fire-resistant in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Steel structures are non-combustible, significantly reducing fire risk compared to wood alternatives and protecting valuable equipment, livestock, and stored inventory. This fire resistance can translate directly into lower insurance premiums and long-term property protection for North and South Florida landowners and agricultural operators.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"mm-faq-lado\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-faq-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/images/pole-barn-4/pole-barn-steel-building-contractors-florida-04.jpg\" alt=\"Covered pole barn with steel roof and treated wood posts, providing durable outdoor storage solutions in Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"mm-faq-accion\"><a class=\"mm-btn\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"testimonial-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"74852c7c-aeb3-35a7-5cf1-44f4ce6ecae5\" class=\"header-reviews\"><div class=\"label\">TESTIMONIALS</div><h2 class=\"white\">What Our Clients Say About Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living</h2><p>Hear from North and South Florida clients who value the strength, versatility, and long-term value of steel barns built by our licensed construction team.</p></div>";
